{"page":454,"verses":[{"verse_key":"38:17","surah":38,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"ٱصْبِرْ عَلَىٰ مَا يَقُولُونَ وَٱذْكُرْ عَبْدَنَا دَاوُۥدَ ذَا ٱلْأَيْدِ ۖ إِنَّهُۥٓ أَوَّابٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Bear their words patiently [Prophet]. Remember Our servant David, a man of strength who always turned to Us:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱصْبِرْ","en_gloss":"Be patient","transliteration":"iṣ'bir","verse_key":"38:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"38:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"38:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","verse_key":"38:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱذْكُرْ","en_gloss":"and remember","transliteration":"wa-udh'kur","verse_key":"38:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَبْدَنَا","en_gloss":"Our slave","transliteration":"ʿabdanā","verse_key":"38:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"دَاوُۥدَ","en_gloss":"Dawood","transliteration":"dāwūda","verse_key":"38:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ذَا","en_gloss":"the possessor of strength","transliteration":"dhā","verse_key":"38:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَيْدِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the possessor of strength","transliteration":"l-aydi","verse_key":"38:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"Indeed, he (was)","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"38:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَوَّابٌ","en_gloss":"repeatedly turning","transliteration":"awwābun","verse_key":"38:17"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٧","en_gloss":"(17)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"38:17"}]},{"verse_key":"38:18","surah":38,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّا سَخَّرْنَا ٱلْجِبَالَ مَعَهُۥ يُسَبِّحْنَ بِٱلْعَشِىِّ وَٱلْإِشْرَاقِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We made the mountains join him in glorifying Us at sunset and sunrise;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, We","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"38:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَخَّرْنَا","en_gloss":"subjected","transliteration":"sakharnā","verse_key":"38:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْجِبَالَ","en_gloss":"the mountains","transliteration":"l-jibāla","verse_key":"38:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَعَهُۥ","en_gloss":"with him","transliteration":"maʿahu","verse_key":"38:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُسَبِّحْنَ","en_gloss":"glorifying","transliteration":"yusabbiḥ'na","verse_key":"38:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلْعَشِىِّ","en_gloss":"in the evening","transliteration":"bil-ʿashiyi","verse_key":"38:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلْإِشْرَاقِ","en_gloss":"and [the] sunrise","transliteration":"wal-ish'rāqi","verse_key":"38:18"},{"pos":8,"ar":"١٨","en_gloss":"(18)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"38:18"}]},{"verse_key":"38:19","surah":38,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلطَّيْرَ مَحْشُورَةً ۖ كُلٌّ لَّهُۥٓ أَوَّابٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and the birds, too, in flocks, all echoed his praise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلطَّيْرَ","en_gloss":"And the birds","transliteration":"wal-ṭayra","verse_key":"38:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَحْشُورَةًۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"assembled","transliteration":"maḥshūratan","verse_key":"38:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كُلٌّۭ","en_gloss":"all","transliteration":"kullun","verse_key":"38:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَّهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"with him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"38:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَوَّابٌۭ","en_gloss":"repeatedly turning","transliteration":"awwābun","verse_key":"38:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"١٩","en_gloss":"(19)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"38:19"}]},{"verse_key":"38:20","surah":38,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"وَشَدَدْنَا مُلْكَهُۥ وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ ٱلْحِكْمَةَ وَفَصْلَ ٱلْخِطَابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We strengthened his kingdom; We gave him wisdom and a decisive way of speaking.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَشَدَدْنَا","en_gloss":"And We strengthened","transliteration":"washadadnā","verse_key":"38:20"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مُلْكَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his kingdom","transliteration":"mul'kahu","verse_key":"38:20"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"and We gave him","transliteration":"waātaynāhu","verse_key":"38:20"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحِكْمَةَ","en_gloss":"[the] wisdom","transliteration":"l-ḥik'mata","verse_key":"38:20"},{