:"","verse_key":"38:23"}]},{"verse_key":"38:24","surah":38,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ لَقَدْ ظَلَمَكَ بِسُؤَالِ نَعْجَتِكَ إِلَىٰ نِعَاجِهِۦ ۖ وَإِنَّ كَثِيرًا مِّنَ ٱلْخُلَطَآءِ لَيَبْغِى بَعْضُهُمْ عَلَىٰ بَعْضٍ إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ وَقَلِيلٌ مَّا هُمْ ۗ وَظَنَّ دَاوُۥدُ أَنَّمَا فَتَنَّـٰهُ فَٱسْتَغْفَرَ رَبَّهُۥ وَخَرَّ رَاكِعًا وَأَنَابَ ۩","en_translation_id":85,"en":"David said, ‘He has done you wrong by demanding to add your ewe to his flock. Many partners treat each other unfairly. Those who sincerely believe and do good deeds do not do this, but these are very few.’ [Then] David realized that We had been testing him, so he asked his Lord for forgiveness, fell down on his knees, and repented:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"38:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَقَدْ","en_gloss":"Certainly","transliteration":"laqad","verse_key":"38:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ظَلَمَكَ","en_gloss":"he has wronged you","transliteration":"ẓalamaka","verse_key":"38:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِسُؤَالِ","en_gloss":"by demanding","transliteration":"bisuāli","verse_key":"38:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَعْجَتِكَ","en_gloss":"your ewe","transliteration":"naʿjatika","verse_key":"38:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"38:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نِعَاجِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"his ewes","transliteration":"niʿājihi","verse_key":"38:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"38:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَثِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"many","transliteration":"kathīran","verse_key":"38:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"38:24"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْخُلَطَآءِ","en_gloss":"the partners","transliteration":"l-khulaṭāi","verse_key":"38:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَيَبْغِى","en_gloss":"certainly oppress","transliteration":"layabghī","verse_key":"38:24"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بَعْضُهُمْ","en_gloss":"some of them","transliteration":