,"verse_key":"38:24"}]},{"verse_key":"38:25","surah":38,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"فَغَفَرْنَا لَهُۥ ذَٰلِكَ ۖ وَإِنَّ لَهُۥ عِندَنَا لَزُلْفَىٰ وَحُسْنَ مَـَٔابٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We forgave him [his misdeed]. His reward will be nearness to Us, a good place to return to.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَغَفَرْنَا","en_gloss":"So We forgave","transliteration":"faghafarnā","verse_key":"38:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"38:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"38:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"38:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"38:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عِندَنَا","en_gloss":"with Us","transliteration":"ʿindanā","verse_key":"38:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَزُلْفَىٰ","en_gloss":"surely is a near access","transliteration":"lazul'fā","verse_key":"38:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَحُسْنَ","en_gloss":"and a good","transliteration":"waḥus'na","verse_key":"38:25"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَـَٔابٍۢ","en_gloss":"place of return","transliteration":"maābin","verse_key":"38:25"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٢٥","en_gloss":"(25)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"38:25"}]},{"verse_key":"38:26","surah":38,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰدَاوُۥدُ إِنَّا جَعَلْنَـٰكَ خَلِيفَةً فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ فَٱحْكُم بَيْنَ ٱلنَّاسِ بِٱلْحَقِّ وَلَا تَتَّبِعِ ٱلْهَوَىٰ فَيُضِلَّكَ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَضِلُّونَ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ شَدِيدٌۢ بِمَا نَسُوا۟ يَوْمَ ٱلْحِسَابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"‘David, We have given you mastery over the land. Judge fairly between people. Do not follow your desires, lest they divert you from God’s path: those who wander from His path will have a painful torment because they ignore the Day of Reckoning.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰدَاوُۥدُ","en_gloss":"O Dawood","transliteration":"yādāwūdu","verse_key":"38:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed